## Pre-LIVE Checklist for Every P-ID

Before declaring a P-ID GREEN:

- [ ] Code change is the smallest correct fix.
- [ ] All four UAT axes (quality / recency / cardinality / latency) verified live.
- [ ] Regression test added under `tests/v9/...`.
- [ ] Targeted test suite passes (`pytest tests/v9/... -q`).
- [ ] Report `docs/reports/PROMPT_<id>.md` reflects post-UAT reality, not pre-UAT plan.
- [ ] Bridge / backend / DB state explicitly recorded in the report.
- [ ] No new `logger.debug` on failure paths — anything that hides a
      bridge or backend error must be `warning` or `error` with rate-limit.
